Package: martian
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, python3-pil, python3-pystray, ${misc:Depends}
Description: RGB controller for Mars Gaming MK-Revo Pro keyboard
 Martian is a lightweight utility to control the LED illumination of the
 Mars Gaming MK-Revo Pro keyboard (258a:0016) on Linux.
 .
 Features:
  - Full keyboard RGB control (all keys, per-key, individual LEDs)
  - Hardware modes (spectrum, breathing, reactive, etc.)
  - System tray integration with color picker
  - Custom color profiles
  - No Windows software required, no OpenRGB needed
 .
 This package is useful for gamers, developers, and Linux enthusiasts who
 want to customize their keyboard lighting on Ubuntu/Debian.
